{"4703930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grilluminati", "steam_appid": 4703930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Grilluminati</strong>, up to 4 cultists must serve one of 3 rivalling gods through bloodshed, worship, and increasingly demanding rituals with increasingly disturbing ingredients. Every shift is a co-op cult operation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Offerings Must Be Made</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the room, isolate your next victim, and take what your god demands before anyone notices. Some rituals require specific body parts. Others demand a full human sacrifice. Dispose of what remains... or put it back on the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/fb48302345591379df170296f98a1e25.poster.avif?t=1785000545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/fb48302345591379df170296f98a1e25.webm?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/fb48302345591379df170296f98a1e25.mp4?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hide the Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests notice missing people, blood trails, strange behavior, and whatever your least competent cultist just dragged through the dining room. Keep the room calm, finish the ritual, and make sure nobody catches you in the act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/a4b5aaca113ceb579230383e316a05d3.poster.avif?t=1785000545\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/a4b5aaca113ceb579230383e316a05d3.webm?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/a4b5aaca113ceb579230383e316a05d3.mp4?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perform Dark Rituals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new powers and tools to harvest the “right” ingredients. Execute rituals together under pressure and push your luck for greater rewards. But beware... when you fail, your god may choose an offering from your own cult instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/4afe35eafa9a0e2240308609fa086d8d.poster.avif?t=1785000545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/4afe35eafa9a0e2240308609fa086d8d.webm?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/4afe35eafa9a0e2240308609fa086d8d.mp4?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon Your God</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the god you want to bring into this world. Each god changes the challenges, rewards, and risks your team faces. Rival gods can interfere mid-shift, creating sudden disruptions that force your team to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/d8eb74bbce321c638e3802788972ddad.poster.avif?t=1785000545\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/d8eb74bbce321c638e3802788972ddad.webm?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/d8eb74bbce321c638e3802788972ddad.mp4?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Cult,  Four Conspirators: </strong>Work together or blame each other when everything spirals out of control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide a Cult in Plain Sight:</strong> Perform dark rituals while maintaining the illusion of a grill restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth, Suspicion &amp; Escalation: </strong>Customers react, panic spreads, and small mistakes become disasters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform Disturbing Rituals: </strong>Harvest bizarre ingredients and unlock new powers, tools, and horrors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rival Gods &amp; Consequences: </strong>Choose your deity, each with unique challenges, rewards, and punishments</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Grilluminati</strong>, up to 4 cultists must serve one of 3 rivalling gods through bloodshed, worship, and increasingly demanding rituals with increasingly disturbing ingredients. Every shift is a co-op cult operation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Offerings Must Be Made</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the room, isolate your next victim, and take what your god demands before anyone notices. Some rituals require specific body parts. Others demand a full human sacrifice. Dispose of what remains... or put it back on the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/fb48302345591379df170296f98a1e25.poster.avif?t=1785000545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/fb48302345591379df170296f98a1e25.webm?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/fb48302345591379df170296f98a1e25.mp4?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hide the Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests notice missing people, blood trails, strange behavior, and whatever your least competent cultist just dragged through the dining room. Keep the room calm, finish the ritual, and make sure nobody catches you in the act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/a4b5aaca113ceb579230383e316a05d3.poster.avif?t=1785000545\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/a4b5aaca113ceb579230383e316a05d3.webm?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/a4b5aaca113ceb579230383e316a05d3.mp4?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perform Dark Rituals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new powers and tools to harvest the “right” ingredients. Execute rituals together under pressure and push your luck for greater rewards. But beware... when you fail, your god may choose an offering from your own cult instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/4afe35eafa9a0e2240308609fa086d8d.poster.avif?t=1785000545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/4afe35eafa9a0e2240308609fa086d8d.webm?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/4afe35eafa9a0e2240308609fa086d8d.mp4?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon Your God</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the god you want to bring into this world. Each god changes the challenges, rewards, and risks your team faces. Rival gods can interfere mid-shift, creating sudden disruptions that force your team to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/d8eb74bbce321c638e3802788972ddad.poster.avif?t=1785000545\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/d8eb74bbce321c638e3802788972ddad.webm?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/extras/d8eb74bbce321c638e3802788972ddad.mp4?t=1785000545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Cult,  Four Conspirators: </strong>Work together or blame each other when everything spirals out of control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide a Cult in Plain Sight:</strong> Perform dark rituals while maintaining the illusion of a grill restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth, Suspicion &amp; Escalation: </strong>Customers react, panic spreads, and small mistakes become disasters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform Disturbing Rituals: </strong>Harvest bizarre ingredients and unlock new powers, tools, and horrors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rival Gods &amp; Consequences: </strong>Choose your deity, each with unique challenges, rewards, and punishments</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Start a cult with friends and summon one of three rivalling gods. Sacrifice customers, perform dark rituals and work together to bring an ancient evil being into the world, all under the cover of a steakhouse.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/c984334a9cee0ac2136ab16f420743cc03588895/header.jpg?t=1785000545", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/716e1ca0fa80eddeebf7a88c9718c113c61064dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785000545", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703930/716e1ca0fa80eddeebf7a88c9718c113c61064dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785000545", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sierra 10.12+</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Anaxanthia", "Godspear Games"], "publishers": ["Anaxanthia"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id":